  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COPOLAD III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the programme is to contribute to the reduction of drugs demand and supply in LAC countries, by facilitating and supporting the required context for the implementation of drugs policies to be more balanced, evidence-based, integral, and thus more effective, fully respectful with the national sovereignty of each LAC country and with the principles of non-interference on internal affairs of the states.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
